# ⌘Z and ⇧⌘Z for sections and spaces (13 Nov 2026, the owner's calls). Remove Section comes back as it
# was, collapsed if it was. In Library ▸ Spaces the keys reach the sidebar's undo (its search field took
# them and did nothing), and what is done to spaces there is a step: a profile set from a card's menu, a
# card moved. Home, Notes and Work are on Default; the Work profile is there to pick.
budget rss=800 stalls50=40
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "favoritesDefaultMigrated": true}
